NOTICE — ha-ws-client

The command behaviour in basic.cjs, registry.cjs, history.cjs, monitor.cjs and
the automation-trace parts of traces.cjs is a port of ha-ws-client, the Go
command-line client in schoolboyqueue/home-assistant-blueprints
(https://github.com/schoolboyqueue/home-assistant-blueprints,
scripts/ha-ws-client-go, release v1.8.1): the same WebSocket calls, arguments,
defaults and JSON output shapes. This app used to download that binary; it now
carries the logic itself. The original licence follows.

